Install python 3.5.4

In windows 10 command prompt run as administrator perform the following

python -m pip install --upgrade pip
pip install pyqt5
pip install pyqt5-tools
pip install wmi
pip install pywin32
pip install fabric2
pip install patchwork
pip install netaddr
pip install tzlocal
pip install pytz
pip install python-dateutil

Need to install Windows 10 SDK to get Visual C++ 14.0 for pycryptodome
Download it from here:
  https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/thank-you-downloading-visual-studio/?sku=BuildTools&rel=15
  Select only the Windows 10 SDK under Individual Components
  Add or fix PATH variable in build_bbm.bat to point where signtool.exe is located

pip install pycryptodome
pip install pyinstaller
pip install https://github.com/pyinstaller/pyinstaller/archive/develop.zip

add the following paths to PATH environment variable
C:\Program Files\Python35\Lib\site-packages\PyQt5
C:\Program Files\Python35\Lib\site-packages\PyQt5\Qt\bin
C:\Program Files\Python35\Scripts

MacDown was used as the MarkDown editor to create the users manual.
